										<li>Drift is measured over time. A single score is a reading, not a direction.</li>
										<li>The functional and structural layers are reproducible. The semantic layer is a model's opinion and should be anchored to a human-labelled gold set before anyone acts on it.</li>
									</ul>
								}
								else if (DriftBusy)
