				case 21:
					<section>
						<p class="kicker">PHASE 0 — BEFORE ANY OF THIS IS SAFE</p>
						<h2 id="scene-title">Name it, tier it, and gate what it sees</h2>
						<p class="rt-intro">You cannot monitor a population you have not enumerated, and "not checked in" does not mean "not sent to a model". These three controls are prerequisites, not follow-ups — so they are <strong>fully deterministic and run with no model at all</strong>. If the bridge is down, the gate still holds.</p>

