													<td>@service.Domain</td>
													<td>@(service.HandlesClientOrders ? "yes" : "no")</td>
													<td>@service.Health</td>
													<td>@(service.DependsOn.Count == 0 ? "—" : string.Join(", ", service.DependsOn))</td>
												</tr>
											}
										</tbody>
									</table>
									<p class="ctx-method">Tier 1 answers <em>what exists and what touches what</em>. It does not record regulatory perimeter, asset-class scope, or how a team accepts change — which is exactly why stopping here is dangerous.</p>
